# Project-specific
.ferret-*
# Project-sanctioned suppression rules MUST be tracked so contributors
# and CI share the same baseline (otherwise every contributor hits the
# same set of false positives on legitimate test fixtures and example
# data — see the file's header for what each block covers).
!.ferret-scan-suppressions.yaml
ferret-scan.local*
ferret-scan.dev*
config.yaml
config.local*
config.dev*
.local/
.dev/
examples/**/*-example
python-package/ferret_scan/binaries/
python-package/dist/
python-package/ferret_scan/_version.py
*.egg-info/

